- Fixed  `toFormData` TS interface;
- Refactored `AxiosURLSearchParams`.
  - Added support for `null` values to be rendered as params without value e.g `{a: null, b: null}` => `/?a&b` (Closes #1139)
 
Suggested release: `1.3.0-alpha.1`

