review_comments.body:
Missing JSON parsing for application/json content type. The code converts to string but doesn't parse JSON, unlike other adapters that automatically parse JSON responses.
```suggestion
            data = Buffer.concat(responseData).toString('utf8');
            // Parse JSON if content-type is application/json
            if (/^application\/json\b/i.test(contentType.trim())) {
              try {
                data = JSON.parse(data);
              } catch (err) {
                // Reject with AxiosError for malformed JSON
                reject(AxiosError.from(err, AxiosError.ERR_BAD_RESPONSE, config, request, {
                  status: status,
                  headers: AxiosHeaders.from(headers)
                }));
                return;
              }
            }
```

